"But that's past now. I want to put it behind us.
  Or... no, perhaps that's arrogance talking."

//【邦氏】
<voice name='邦氏' class='邦氏' src='voice/mb02/0120490b49'>
//「でも、桜子どのがいつまでも肩身のせまい
//思いをすることはないと思う……」
"But at least, I don't want her to feel like she has nowhere left to turn."

pt:
//【邦氏】
<voice name='邦氏' class='邦氏' src='voice/mb02/0120470b49'>
